                                "sense_id": "e33c4814-79cb-36da-9aa5-6430d3a7ece2",
                                "text": "Do you agree that a bologna sandwich is a satisfactory meal, whereas caviar and champagne, roast duck and baked Alaska, that might be considered a delightful meal? We object, these gastronomical comments are irrelevant to these proceedings, your Honor."
                            }
